          <a href="#repair-or-replace" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">11. Warranty, Parts and Repair or Replace</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">12. Frequently Asked Questions</a>
